OL,3,AMichael Sheen says being an actor will
OL,4,Abe a disadvantage on Celebrity Traitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Sheen has said he thinks being
OL,7,Fan actor will be a disadvantage while
OL,8,Fhe is on Celebrity Traitors.
OL,10,FThe 57-year-old is among the stars who
OL,11,Fwill go head to head in the second
OL,12,Fseries of the BBC reality game
OL,13,Fspin-off.
OL,15,FA total of 21 presenters, comedians,
OL,16,Factors and musicians will try their
OL,17,Fhand at being traitors and faithfuls in
OL,18,Fthe show, which airs on 1 October.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
