OL,3,AMichael Sheen says being an actor will
OL,4,Abe a disadvantage on Celebrity Traitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Hollywood actor from Port Talbot
OL,7,Fsaid he wanted to participate because
OL,8,Fhe is a "big fan" of the show and
OL,9,Fwanted to be in the castle after
OL,10,Fpreviously filming in the area.
